  "summary": "Nelson Rolihlahla Mandela (1918-2013) was a South African lawyer and African National Congress leader. Tried for sabotage and sentenced to life imprisonment in 1964, he spent 27 years in prison (SAHO) until release on 11 February 1990, shared the 1993 Nobel Peace Prize with F. W. de Klerk, and in 1994 became South Africa's first democratically elected president.",
